SY_TALK("pPUX9iI8RaM",[[3,["The other day, on the radio,","they asked a very nice question,"]],[9,["which I think I should handle first."]],[14,["The question was What is the difference","between other sects and Sahaja Yoga?"]],[22,["It’s a very good question because","it gives you a relative idea"]],[27,["as to what is reality,","and what is not."]],[33,["First of all, we should see","what is the need of Sahaja Yoga."]],[40,["Sahaja, as you know, is Saha,","means with, Ja means born;"]],[48,["is born with you."]],[49,["Means is spontaneous, it is with you."]],[52,["What is with you is the right","to be united with the Divine,"]],[58,["that’s, to be in yoga,","to be united with God."]],[65,["Now, there are people who","just don’t believe in God, either –"]],[68,["is quite possible, they are frightened","to hear the name of God,"]],[72,["because of various experiences","they have had,"]],[75,["the various ideologies","that have prevailed."]],[78,["But God exists, no doubt,","whether you like it or not."]],[82,["But unless and until you have felt","the existence of God,"]],[85,["to believe in God is difficult;","one can understand that."]],[92,["Now, what is Sahaja Yoga?"]],[95,["In Sahaja Yoga what actually happens","to a personality is this:"]],[101,["that the sleeping power,","or we can say un-awakened power within you,"]],[107,["which is your germinating power, rises,"]],[111,["passes through the various","subtle centers within you,"]],[115,["and pierces through this fontanel area,"]],[119,["and, what we call it, as a baptism,"]],[123,["as a blessing or the grace","of the Holy Ghost,"]],[127,["you get your realization."]],[130,["It’s a happening, it’s actualization,","it is living, it is living."]],[134,["It is the blessing of the living God,","not of an artificial one."]],[138,["Like anybody calling you, says","Alright, let me baptize you"]],[141,["and just puts their hand on the head;","it may not be baptism at all,"]],[146,["because how can he, because he has not","raised your Kundalini?"]],[149,["It’s like any seed, supposing we have,","and the seed, we say that this seed is living,"]],[155,["alright? How do you prove it?"]],[158,["Unless and until you germinate it,","how can you prove that it’s a living thing?"]],[162,["So, the germination has to take place."]],[165,["Unless and until that happens,","how can people believe in anything,"]],[168,["whatever you may call it?"]],[170,["So, this rebirth has to take place,","as everybody has told."]],[174,["Now, we need not sort of deny all that,","defy all that,"]],[178,["but we can keep ourselves open","to understand what is the thing"]],[183,["they are talking about."]],[187,["Now, why? What is the need,","what is the need for a person"]],[190,["to get his realization?","That’s the main thing."]],[194,["First of all, people have said,","You are the Spirit."]],[197,["All right, we may be so; why?"]],[199,["What is the need to be the Spirit?"]],[202,["We are all right as human beings,","as flesh, everything;"]],[205,["what is the need to be realized?"]],[209,["And once you understand the need,","then you’ll understand what is Sahaja Yoga,"]],[213,["and what the other sects are."]],[216,["The need is this, that you are a part","and parcel of the whole."]],[222,["Like a big primordial being","you can think of,"]],[226,["and He has many cells,","and you are one of the cells."]],[229,["But you are not aware of it.","You are not yet collective."]],[235,["Now, the difference between collective","and a mass system is different."]],[241,["In a mass system, I mean,","you can hypnotize complete masses –"]],[245,["they’ll start dancing, jumping,","screaming, shouting."]],[249,["You can do what you like to masses;"]],[251,["I mean, if the masses are","of a weak-minded thing"]],[254,["you can ask them to commit suicide."]],[256,["You can tell them anything they will do,","if you just want to use the mass media."]],[261,["Like they become hysteric."]],[263,["Actually, it is a special thing within us","which makes you mimic others;"]],[269,["is a very ancient thing within us,","very, very ancient,"]],[273,["that we were – as animals –","we used to do that."]],[277,["See, you have seen birds."]],[278,["Have you ever seen the birds","like cranes flying out?"]],[282,["They always go in a triangular way,"]],[285,["and as the one, the leader, turns,","all the rest of them follow it,"]],[290,["very automatically."]],[292,["So that’s this instinct we had","to follow others, you see, to copy others."]],[298,["That’s a very deep training to our being,","that we try to follow others, and that’s why;"]],[308,["what happens, we see some people","going somewhere,"]],[313,["so we think Oh, we should also","do the same thing."]],[316,["It’s that competition between us."]],[318,["See, this competitiveness has also come","from the same seed within us"]],[324,["of copying others."]],[326,["See, we try to copy others,","like clubbing, now, we have a club,"]],[330,["say, club of people who dress up","like white, suits and things."]],[335,["Then there are clubs","with a certain type of dress,"]],[339,["or you can find, as I last time told you,","yards and yards of black suitings,"]],[345,["walking in elite societies.","I mean, it’s just clubbing you know."]],[350,["They just want to club it together,","put it together, then uniforms are there,"]],[354,["and then you have to wear the uniforms,"]],[356,["and you sort of feel that","you are a part of the mass."]],[361,["It’s a part of the mass, now.","Again, this is a mass thing."]],[364,["But Sahaja Yoga is a collective thing."]],[369,["People talk of collectivity,","all of them talk of collectivity,"]],[372,["but it is only rational,","it is artificial."]],[374,["For example, a husband and wife","must live together happily."]],[378,["Now the reason for that they give is","that if they don’t live happily,"]],[382,["this will happen to children,","that will happen to children,"]],[385,["that will happen, and that it may be","that it won’t be good for both of them,"]],[390,["so we reason it out, go to a point,","a rational point you call it,"]],[394,["a logical point where we say,","Alright, we should not give up"]],[397,["the relationship","between husband and wife."]],[401,["But supposing husband and wife","get realized."]],[406,["Then, what happens,","they become aware of their duty as parents,"]],[409,["aware."]],[412,["Awareness is a very different thing","from just be in mass."]],[419,["Like, husband, wife feel that, you see,","marriage is not thinking"]],[424,["but you just feel it within yourself,","not as a feeling of emotional style,"]],[432,["but actually becomes your being."]],[435,["For example, after realization","you start feeling the cool breeze in the hand."]],[440,["But supposing the husband wife","are trying to deceive each other,"]],[444,["immediately the vibrations will go away."]],[447,["They’ll feel no cool breeze –","it’s finished."]],[449,["They cannot proceed more","further within."]],[452,["Supposing a person has bad habits,","say some dirty habits he has developed"]],[456,["in his childhood,","and he’s continuing with it."]],[459,["After realization,","if he starts indulging into it,"]],[462,["immediately he’ll find","he’s feeling uneasy"]],[464,["and his vibrations are lost."]],[467,["He becomes aware – means on his","central nervous system"]],[470,["he can feel the bad effects","of what we call as bad."]],[475,["He feels burning, he feels","different centers are in trouble,"]],[479,["I mean he can feel it just like as you can","feel it hot and cold on your fingers."]],[487,["So, when you become aware,","then real collectivity can come."]],[492,["It is not a rational thing to say,","Oh, we are interdependent,"]],[496,["and we have to help each other."]],[499,["We must do this in a way","that nobody should be harmed,"]],[504,["that we should not be harmed."]],[506,["All this rationality is not needed –"]],[507,["for, supposing tomorrow,","if somebody tries to put a pin through,"]],[513,["immediately the other hand will go there","and hit the person"]],[516,["and this hand will go back."]],[520,["All the body will react, automatically."]],[524,["The whole body will react","to aggression on one side,"]],[530,["or any kind of problem, but it is aware."]],[535,["It is not doing with rationality,","there is no, it is spontaneous."]],[540,["There is no question","of anybody thinking about it,"]],[546,["but it happens just spontaneously."]],[549,["So, to preserve ourselves,","to preserve our body, mind, everything,"]],[561,["is a disintegrated action","before realization."]],[565,["For example, before Realization,","the brain will say, All right, you do like this,"]],[573,["but the heart will say, No."]],[574,["For example, supposing a man","falls in love with a married woman,"]],[578,["so the heart says,","Oh, carry on, she’s a nice lady."]],[582,["Brain says, No it’s not proper you see,","disturbing her family life is not a good thing."]],[586,["The dharma, the religion part","in the stomach, which is also a reality,"]],[590,["it is not the dharma we talk of","in the church or anything."]],[594,["The gentleman can come here, please,","there’s a seat here."]],[602,["May God bless you."]],[602,["So that can be done,","but the realized person does everything"]],[611,["in an integrated way."]],[614,["In an integrated way,","like if he is in love with a married lady,"]],[623,["immediately he cannot fall also,","he cannot fall in love with a married lady,"]],[627,["just will not, he just doesn’t do."]],[630,["No question of them saying,","Lead us not into temptation,"]],[632,["you just don’t do bad things."]],[634,["We just don’t like it,","because you become aware,"]],[637,["and the awareness is not rational at all."]],[640,["We cannot think of awareness","which is not rational,"]],[645,["because whatever is not rational,","according to us, is nonsensical,"]],[650,["is erratical, is arbitrary,","is nonsensical."]],[655,["But it is a sense that develops with you."]],[658,["It’s an actual sense within you","that develops,"]],[662,["not the way it is developed","with thinking, the sense with your mind,"]],[668,["but the sense in your organs,","in your body, in your being and in your heart,"]],[675,["that you just don’t do it."]],[677,["This is awareness","and this is collectivity,"]],[679,["and those who cannot rise","to collectivity cannot be good Sahaja Yogis."]],[684,["And once you understand that this comes","through the awakening of your spirit,"]],[691,["then you understand all the problems","of the world can only be solved"]],[695,["if human beings","become that collective being."]],[699,["That collective being is the Spirit,","and this collective being, if it is,"]],[704,["if it is somehow awakened","in our attention,"]],[709,["then we automatically become that."]],[714,["Automatically we become","collectively conscious."]],[718,["We don’t have to rationalize it –","just there."]],[720,["Means a little child will immediately say","Oh, Mother, see, this man has got problems."]],[730,["Now, how do you know?","Oh, all my fingers are burning."]],[737,["That person is not denounced","because he’s not well,"]],[740,["whatever may be the problem."]],[742,["That person is not discarded,","nor is told that he’s good for nothing,"]],[749,["but immediately you feel the problem","as a witness of that person,"]],[755,["and you have a power,","because you are collectively conscious."]],[758,["As you can correct within yourself","you can correct others also,"]],[761,["because you are collectively conscious."]],[763,["Means you have the power","to correct another person,"]],[766,["to relieve him of the pain,","troubles and everything,"]],[769,["to help him out, to cure him,","to do whatever is needed just by yourself."]],[778,["Because, at the point where you are,","at the Spirit point,"]],[783,["you are one with the Spirit."]],[786,["I would say, like, while I’m talking to you,","I’m only connected with this to you,"]],[791,["but supposing I was on a radio station,","then I’m connected with many."]],[797,["That point of connection is the Spirit,"]],[801,["and unless and until you have achieved","that point of connection,"]],[804,["the rest of your – all your doings –","are good for nothing."]],[808,["Now, what is the difference","between a sect and Sahaja Yoga?"]],[812,["In Sahaja Yoga, an individual,","an individual;"]],[817,["again, we are all individuals","before Realization."]],[820,["The other day, as I told you in Easter,","we are all like the eggs,"]],[823,["and that’s the sign of a human being,","that he’s still an egg."]],[827,["He lives in a shell, he thinks of himself,","he thinks of his family, it’s good in a way,"]],[832,["he thinks of his country.","Everything good, up to that point,"]],[836,["because he’s a shell."]],[838,["Whatever he tries to make himself big,","you see, United Nations,"]],[842,["everything you’ve been,","but that shell business will remain in you."]],[846,["It will be there, showing results."]],[849,["But when you get that shell","broken completely,"]],[853,["you are a bird, you just fly out."]],[859,["So, the Day of Resurrection, as I said,","the Day of Resurrection, has started,"]],[863,["is mentioned in the Koran, many a times,"]],[866,["much more times than","about the Day of Doom."]],[869,["This is the Day of Resurrection,","where people have to be resurrected"]],[874,["to be their Spirits,","as Christ Himself has done that for us,"]],[879,["by crossing the gates of Agnya chakra."]],[885,["Now this is not a sect, because there is","nothing unreal about it, nothing unreal."]],[892,["There’s no hypnosis, nothing,","you are completely aware of what you are doing,"]],[897,["you are aware that there is your power","within yourself,"]],[901,["and that power is flowing,","and that you become that power."]],[905,["But that power is not of domination,","or overpowering anybody,"]],[908,["but of love, but of love of God,"]],[912,["which is doing each and every work","of this world."]],[915,["For these flowers have come out","from that,"]],[917,["these flowers become fruit","because of that."]],[920,["Because of that power","people conceive children,"]],[924,["because of that you are born,","because of that power"]],[927,["you have become","from amoeba to this stage."]],[930,["So, that instinct of the mass","is very much now prevalent,"]],[936,["and used in this sense."]],[938,["They just give a mass feeling to people,","that, you see, a competition is set in."]],[945,["First of all, in all these western cities,","western cities especially,"]],[949,["people are conscious","of their money power."]],[954,["So, they use that also,","so you pay some money;"]],[958,["like on a horse,","you pay a certain amount,"]],[961,["they pay for a sect."]],[962,["So much money, I’ll pay.","The other says, Have you paid so much?"]],[964,["I mean, you’ll be surprised,","in the elite societies they talk like that –"]],[968,["Oh, these days, you know,","I’m having so much of money,"]],[974,["and I want to go and join a sect –","this sect or that sect or that sect."]],[979,["Because a competition has set in."]],[981,["Anywhere you see these musicians","and singers when they sing."]],[986,["Actually, it was all maneuvered,","it was all maneuvered in the beginning,"]],[990,["that they get hold of some people","who are weak-minded,"]],[993,["who do not know their willpower,","so to overpower them and use that instinct,"]],[1001,["that subconscious instinct in them","to excite them,"]],[1006,["and once they’re excited","they all go mad, all go mad,"]],[1009,["and they become hysterical."]],[1012,["And that hysteria is used today,","out and out, by all the sects,"]],[1017,["and that’s why people are so crazy."]],[1019,["If you look at them,","you can’t believe they’re anywhere near God."]],[1022,["How can they be?","They all look crazy, possessed, mad people."]],[1028,["But this collectivity is to be understood","in its own dimensions in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1034,["This is the second task of Sahaja Yoga,","which is more difficult than the first one."]],[1039,["To give realization is not at all difficult,","because it’s a natural thing,"]],[1043,["it is within you, the time has come,","the blossom time is there,"]],[1046,["you get realization without much difficulty."]],[1048,["If not in one sitting,","in second sitting you’ll get it, no doubt,"]],[1052,["but to establish you as a collective cell","of the whole is a very difficult thing,"]],[1059,["and unless and until you are that","you are thrown out of the whole."]],[1063,["If you don’t become aware of it","you are just thrown out."]],[1069,["Now, collectivity in Sahaja Yoga","does not mean that you wear some kind of dresses –"]],[1074,["all of you wearing same kind of dresses,","or doing the same type of thing,"]],[1078,["or jumping or any such thing","which has no sensible logic in it."]],[1086,["It is the collectivity","that you feel within yourself,"]],[1089,["that nearness you feel, not emotionally,","also I would say,"]],[1094,["people think it’s an emotional attachment","to people. It’s not emotionally also –"]],[1098,["it is beyond emotions,","it is beyond thought, it is the Spirit."]],[1104,["Because everybody has got","this Spirit in them."]],[1107,["Only thing,","you have to become the Spirit."]],[1110,["Now anything you see, even,","we can say, going to a temple."]],[1114,["Now, in India, ladies are busy dressing up","if they have to go to the temple."]],[1119,["They’ll find out What sari she’s wearing,","what sari am I going to wear?"]],[1123,["like we do it in the churches also."]],[1125,["We go there with our best dresses,"]],[1126,["just watching what dress she has on,","then we come out of the church,"]],[1131,["directly we ask the question,","Where did you get this one?, you see."]],[1134,["So, the whole attention","is on a social contact,"]],[1139,["a social mass feeling within ourselves."]],[1141,["So, we are not individuals","at all at that time, not at all."]],[1144,["First, we have to be absolute individuals,","and then you become a complete,"]],[1152,["aware part of the whole."]],[1155,["But, if you are not an individual,","say that’s why people who belong to these sects,"]],[1159,["or belong to some sort of a commitment,","or to an organized place,"]],[1165,["they find it difficult, because they are not","yet prepared to accept that individual jump"]],[1173,["into the whole."]],[1176,["If the whole of it comes, well and good."]],[1178,["If the whole doesn’t come,","they are sticking on to it,"]],[1181,["though it can be very superficial also,","like, you see, in England is a custom"]],[1186,["to put the fork and spoon","in a particular way."]],[1189,["In France it is different,","in somewhere it is different."]],[1193,["Now, even that can be","a club-forming stuff for us,"]],[1196,["because, you see, we are Americans","we’ll put it this way,"]],[1198,["we are English we’ll put it this way,","if we are French, we’ll put it this way."]],[1202,["But it is such a superficial","sort of a thing"]],[1204,["and if you go into it","it’s all superficial."]],[1207,["All our clubbing is superficial."]],[1210,["Now, if you start getting after it","and reacting against it,"]],[1214,["then you are destroying yourself.","You are completely destroyed."]],[1217,["There is no need to destroy","anything like that,"]],[1220,["but to be understanding","that this is superficial."]],[1223,["Nothing, you should not waste your energy","in fighting anyone of these."]],[1228,["There is no need to fight anything,","to get out of it."]],[1231,["There’s no need to fight any such thing."]],[1233,["What happens, that by fighting","you lose your energy for nothing at all."]],[1237,["On the contrary, you should understand","that all these things are artificial,"]],[1243,["and you should wait for a moment","when you get the reality."]],[1246,["But if you fight them also","there’s a problem."]],[1249,["If you don’t fight them and you become one,","there’s a problem."]],[1252,["So, both things are energy-sapping."]],[1255,["We go on thinking, thinking,","thinking about it, where do we reach?"]],[1258,["We reach nowhere."]],[1262,["So, Sahaja Yoga is a system","which is the system of the nature."]],[1267,["Is not a system of human beings,","which is artificial, or an organization,"]],[1272,["or a mass movement,","nothing of the kind!"]],[1275,["Is the system of the nature itself,","which has made you a human being,"]],[1280,["an individual, now, like an egg."]],[1284,["Now this individual has to become,","not the mass, which is an animal instinct,"]],[1292,["but to become collectively conscious,","has to become."]],[1298,["Is a consciousness, means","on the central nervous system"]],[1303,["you feel that consciousness,","and that is what is the reality."]],[1309,["We go about into anything understanding","that this is right, that is right, is all mental."]],[1318,["If you understand everything","whatever is mentally available,"]],[1324,["you are still in the shell."]],[1327,["But what you feel is the point."]],[1332,["What you feel on your central nervous system","is your real consciousness."]],[1339,["The rest of it is your mental activities,","imagination,"]],[1343,["or whatever is mental is manmade,","it has no meaning."]],[1347,["Like we have written books after books,"]],[1349,["I don’t know how many energies have been","wasted in doing all sorts of things."]],[1353,["Books after books are written about this,","that, all kinds of yarns and yarns of,"]],[1360,["I should say,","imaginary wanderings about things."]],[1364,["But that’s not the thing, you see,","it’s within yourself."]],[1367,["That’s within yourself,","is your own Spirit,"]],[1372,["that resides there in your heart,","is your own power, which you should get."]],[1376,["And if you can feel that power","then you will be amazed"]],[1380,["that you don’t have to have","any United Nations Organization and all that."]],[1384,["You really enter into the Kingdom of God","in the sense that you get that power of love,"]],[1390,["which makes you extremely loving, sweet,","I should say magnetic, extremely gentle,"]],[1400,["and also could be very powerful","if it comes to use of power."]],[1404,["It’s extremely powerful."]],[1406,["In your behaviour you become","an extremely attractive person"]],[1411,["in the sense that","you do not give trouble to others."]],[1415,["You do not – on the contrary,","you are a trouble-shooter, I should say,"]],[1419,["you are a person who is a peacemaker."]],[1421,["Wherever you stand","you create peace and happiness,"]],[1424,["but this is still outward."]],[1427,["Inside, you are so tranquil and blissful,","and the highest above is that"]],[1432,["you are so connected that, even verbally,","if you ask any question, Is there God?"]],[1438,["you start getting great vibrations."]],[1441,["The rapport is established;","you can see the rapport is now established;"]],[1444,["you can talk to God."]],[1447,["It’s easy to say that there is no God;","it’s very good,"]],[1451,["because then we have no headaches,","people think,"]],[1453,["but all the headaches come","because of this kind of a belief also,"]],[1457,["that there is no God."]],[1458,["And also, there will be headaches","if you believe that there is God"]],[1461,["without knowing it."]],[1463,["Both things, according to Me,","are still the two sides of a pendulum."]],[1469,["It is not in the centre,","or we can say this is how we go"]],[1473,["to the right and to the left,","but do not ascend."]],[1476,["For the ascent, this actual thing,","this living thing, this germination,"]],[1482,["has to take place,","and that is why Sahaja Yoga"]],[1485,["transcends all these","nonsensical sects, absolutely."]],[1489,["It has no respect for them,","it has no respect,"]],[1494,["because it saps the energy","of human beings, it puts them down,"]],[1500,["it doesn’t give them a chance to rise","to their own power which is within themselves."]],[1506,["But, with understanding that, after all,","human beings are ignorant about it,"]],[1511,["they are not very sure,","it’s alright if they’re involved"]],[1515,["with any other such things,","doesn’t matter."]],[1519,["But, in a sect, if you go –","I was surprised,"]],[1520,["I went to a Unity Church","a Unity Church, imagine, Unity Church, in Houston."]],[1527,["They were kind enough to invite me there","and they didn’t know how outspoken I was"]],[1532,["about things, you see,","poor things were in for trouble I think,"]],[1535,["after My coming."]],[1536,["But whatever it is, I was surprised;","they were selling all kinds of books there,"]],[1541,["all kinds, which are satanic,","which are mass movements,"]],[1546,["which are very detrimental","to human beings, and they knew they were."]],[1551,["Like, in a church they were selling books","of a man who is treating licentiousness,"]],[1556,["permissiveness, can you imagine?","Such a contradictory thing,"]],[1559,["I mean either Christ was wrong","or this man was wrong,"]],[1562,["how can you have both the things together?"]],[1564,["And they were saying This is Unity.","This is not unity; this is not unity."]],[1569,["This is such a superficial unity","of getting all the dust, filth everything together"]],[1575,["and gold with it,","and saying Now you have it."]],[1578,["Do you put in your food the poison","and then eat it,"]],[1581,["because you want to unite it?"]],[1584,["You can only unite things","which can be united."]],[1587,["You cannot unite all the mess","of the world together"]],[1590,["and say this is unity."]],[1592,["You cannot unite Christ with a man","who is teaching licentiousness,"]],[1596,["permissiveness","and all kinds of dirty tricks."]],[1600,["So, one has to understand","the mind plays a very big trick,"]],[1604,["that the mind itself is a very,","very tricky thing,"]],[1607,["it’s a very intelligent thing,","and it beats you."]],[1610,["And you start understanding,","Oh, let it be, doesn’t matter"]],[1613,["and you start compromising."]],[1616,["How can there be compromise","between the food and the poison?"]],[1618,["Can you have strychnine with food?","Simple thing as that."]],[1622,["We have to separate, we have to say,","This wrong, this is right."]],[1627,["Whether people like it or not,","if we have to respect human life,"]],[1631,["if you have to respect","this great creation of God,"]],[1635,["if you have to see that they get","what that is promised to them,"]],[1639,["are we going to play with their lives,","with their body, with everything?"]],[1643,["Like there are some people who believe","that drugs can take you to God."]],[1647,["I mean, just imagine the absurdity of it."]],[1651,["Now, thank God people know that drugs","harm your attention, harm your awareness."]],[1661,["There was a book written, I was told,","I met somebody in Vancouver,"]],[1665,["who has got a PhD,","by a book which was written by –"]],[1673,["I’ve forgotten the name of the gentleman –"]],[1675,["who has described that the alcohol","takes you to spiritual life."]],[1681,["And I say absurd."]],[1683,["The thing that goes against","your awareness itself,"]],[1686,["how can it take you to awareness","which is enlightened?"]],[1692,["It would be something like","to cover this light,"]],[1695,["break all the bulbs, everything,","and that will take you to light."]],[1700,["It is absolutely absurd.","The whole statement is absurd."]],[1705,["You cannot go to God if you try","to harm your body, harm your mind,"]],[1712,["harm yourself."]],[1713,["Even a person who has had a bad childhood,","who has suffered because of something,"]],[1718,["say war, or something,","even such a person is a little less blessed"]],[1726,["in the beginning;","we have to work on him to put his mind at rest,"]],[1730,["put his body at rest, to see","that there is equilibrium within him,"]],[1736,["and then only he can get realization."]],[1738,["Anybody who is a disturbed man,","who is upset, we have to put it right."]],[1742,["Now, some people have definitely felt","that drugs are going to solve the problem,"]],[1747,["honestly they have felt it;","I know they have been very honest about it."]],[1750,["They have taken drugs; doesn’t matter."]],[1751,["That also can be neutralized,","because you are seekers;"]],[1754,["you have just done that","because you are seeking."]],[1757,["Is that – the main thing is that","you must see and that you must get it,"]],[1761,["is the main object of Sahaja Yoga,","that is yours."]],[1764,["So, whatever may come,","whatever may have happened, doesn’t matter."]],[1769,["It’s going to be corrected,","it’s going to work out."]],[1772,["And then, overnight, people give up","because they realize that this is it."]],[1779,["All problems of humanity are","because we have not yet found out our Spirit,"]],[1784,["which is a collective being."]],[1788,["All international problems, say,","all your political problems,"]],[1792,["all your economic problems,","come from that one thing"]],[1796,["which has not happened to human beings;","you are still in transition."]],[1799,["I would say it would be something like","people who are still in the water,"]],[1804,["getting halfway up and halfway down."]],[1808,["They don’t know whether","we are to be saved or not."]],[1810,["But once you have reached the shores","that’s all right."]],[1814,["That’s a little breakthrough","that has to take place"]],[1816,["and people have to establish","their collective consciousness."]],[1820,["So, there are many who get realization,","you see, many come here,"]],[1823,["they get their realization,","then disappear. I have seen."]],[1826,["They feel very happy,","everything done, now!"]],[1828,["Nothing; you have to become","collectively conscious after that."]],[1832,["Means you have to educate yourself","to understand how to feel"]],[1842,["that collectivity within yourself."]],[1843,["That is more important,","more difficult for human beings,"]],[1848,["because they all like –","what do you say? – a quick happening,"]],[1855,["a very quick happening."]],[1856,["And a quick happening takes place,","no doubt,"]],[1859,["but that quick happening is just taking you","to a point where you have to stay,"]],[1864,["you have to become."]],[1866,["If becoming is the thing,","like an egg breaks into a nice little bird,"]],[1874,["but the bird must learn to fly."]],[1877,["If it does not educate itself to fly,","it remains something in between egg and bird,"]],[1884,["and anybody can eat that off."]],[1886,["It has no quality as a bird","which can save itself, protect itself,"]],[1891,["and can fly and enjoy."]],[1892,["It has no quality of a bird","if it is just roaming about like cock and hens,"]],[1901,["you see, when they were in the forest,","they used to fly,"]],[1904,["I have seen these forest ones","flying very high."]],[1908,["They can fly just like an eagle,","but if you see them on the ground,"]],[1913,["if they are settled down on the ground,"]],[1914,["they are eaten up by people","who can catch them – anybody can catch them."]],[1920,["So, to have that quality,","the quality of that collective being,"]],[1924,["one has to educate and rise above","that shell system,"]],[1929,["that system that has bound them,","that has made them an individual,"]],[1933,["which was important, to have a shell for you.","The individuality was very, very important,"]],[1937,["otherwise you would not have been matured."]],[1939,["So that, a time comes that shell","must be broken."]],[1944,["Like now, the car is important for me","to bring down here,"]],[1949,["but I have to leave the car","to come down inside."]],[1951,["In the same way you have reached","a certain stage that,"]],[1954,["up to that point it was alright,","but you don’t have to carry it on any further,"]],[1959,["and you have to settle down","with the new dimension,"]],[1963,["a new life within you, and that’s what is","your second birth."]],[1970,["For this, God has placed everything","within ourselves, you see there a system –"]],[1977,["did anybody speak about Kundalini?","You should have."]],[1978,["All right, doesn’t matter."]],[1978,["Now, you see, every time I don’t want","to repeat about Kundalini and all that."]],[1982,["And there is a system within us","called the Kundalini. All is within us."]],[1991,["Now, it is very easy to sit down and say,","Now, Mother, how do you say it is so?"]],[1997,["I mean, it’s good, you see, because","people want to know about it,"]],[2003,["how is it we have the Kundalini","in the triangular bone?"]],[2009,["And then we say that there are subtle centers","which look after,"]],[2013,["I mean which manifest outside","our gross centers, and all these things."]],[2016,["We do talk about it, but you can all doubt,","Let’s see, how can there be such a thing?"]],[2023,["How are we to believe You? But why not?"]],[2026,["Because I’m not taking","any money from you, nothing."]],[2030,["By believing Me, what is your loss?","It’s nothing."]],[2033,["Now the people who are here,","you should see, and ask them."]],[2036,["Their lives are all changed.","They have become different people."]],[2038,["They’re enjoying themselves,","they’ve got their own powers,"]],[2041,["they can manifest them,","they have become experts."]],[2043,["They look so simple, just like you,","but if you see their faces"]],[2046,["you will see how blooming they are."]],[2049,["Apart from that, that they know all about it,","they are masters and scholars,"]],[2054,["and they are great gurus,","sitting down here around you,"]],[2057,["and you can also become that."]],[2059,["So, there’s nothing to doubt."]],[2061,["But now, supposing you are","a doubting Thomas, you see, you will doubt."]],[2065,["I don’t mind if you doubt, also.","We’ll try to solve the doubt."]],[2069,["The main thing is","of making you the Spirit."]],[2073,["That’s our job. For that we are here","and you are also for that,"]],[2078,["so it is better to cooperate with us","than to argue and discuss"]],[2082,["and spoil everybody’s attention."]],[2084,["You see, some people are","such reactionaries, they come,"]],[2087,["ask questions, and when it comes","to realization they just run away."]],[2091,["Mostly we have seen such people,"]],[2092,["who sit down with a very doubting mind","all the time,"]],[2096,["but for what are you doubting?","What are you going to lose?"]],[2101,["What are you going to lose here? Nothing."]],[2103,["If you have a cancer you can be cured."]],[2105,["If you have mental problems","they can be cured,"]],[2108,["all the problems can be cured","as a blessing of God."]],[2110,["It’s true, and, apart from that,","you become your own power."]],[2115,["But if it is a mass system","you don’t doubt."]],[2116,["You see so, for example, we go to church,","we don’t doubt, just we don’t doubt."]],[2116,["We don’t doubt the priest,","we don’t doubt anybody."]],[2125,["We go to a temple, we never doubt the priest,","we just pay as everybody’s paying –"]],[2129,["it’s a mass system."]],[2131,["It is not – here you are an individual,","and that’s why you doubt."]],[2135,["You are an individual now and you doubt,"]],[2138,["but I would suggest that better","to have your realization"]],[2142,["than to waste your energy in doubting."]],[2144,["Because if you are all seekers,","you are going to get your realization,"]],[2147,["if not today, tomorrow."]],[2149,["But only thing, why delay?","Sooner the better."]],[2152,["But if you have any questions,","I would like to answer them."]],[2155,["We have all this Kundalini and all that","and I wish Gavin had told you about it"]],[2159,["or somebody should have told you."]],[2160,["Next time we’ll have a lecture","about Kundalini, what it is,"]],[2165,["how it gives realization, how it rises,","how it pierces through different chakras,"]],[2170,["pierces through your fontanel bone area,"]],[2173,["and also how it gives you","of these Chaitanya Lahiris,"]],[2185,["what we call as the Cool Breeze","in the hand:"]],[2185,["cool breeze of the Holy Ghost,","and that’s what you have to see."]],[2188,["Now, if you have any questions, you may ask,","because when you are getting realization,"]],[2192,["I want you to be free, because you have","to go beyond thought,"]],[2195,["and it just happens","without any difficulty,"]],[2198,["there’s nothing to worry."]],[2199,["Now there are people who say that","Kundalini’s very dangerous and all that."]],[2202,["Maybe for people who do not know","anything about it –"]],[2205,["like if you put your hand inside this,","you’ll get a shock,"]],[2208,["because they don’t what this means,","you see, but the one who knows the job"]],[2213,["knows it – it’s very simple.","Even children can do it if they know it."]],[2216,["If you have any questions, please ask me."]],[2230,["Please ask, if you have any questions."]],[2247,["You should ask me some questions."]],[2251,["How many of you have listened","to the radio and have come?"]],[2255,["Any one of you? Is good, good.","Yes, it’s good."]],[2260,["So, you thought it was very convincing?","What he said it? Is it?"]],[2265,["Good. I’m happy. That’s John."]],[2270,["(laughs)"]],[2270,["He’s doing Theology,","and he’s now fed up."]],[2273,["He says, Mother, theology is just","talk, talk, talk, talk, talk"]],[2276,["and but he should have said","one more point, as I said."]],[2279,["John and Fergy, is he here?","Fergy, he’s there."]],[2284,["Both of them had gone, but he didn’t say","that you get your own power."]],[2290,["You see, in a cult you do not get your power,","you’re just like mad, all of you,"]],[2294,["walking into some sort of a blind alley,","but you don’t know where you are leading to."]],[2300,["You must know what you are doing,","what it is, everything about it."]],[2304,["Good, I’m happy that you were","so convinced by his, this thing,"]],[2310,["but we found it impossible to handle","these people of the media."]],[2317,["Very funny upset people, I tell you."]],[2320,["They don’t want to – they abhor truth,","I really tell you, they abhor truth."]],[2323,["Most surprising is that when you","tell them the truth they are really upset."]],[2328,["They don’t want to hear, you see."]],[2329,["If you tell them some hanky-panky stories","they are very happy"]],[2332,["and they would like to help you","if there’s a hanky-panky story behind it,"]],[2335,["but if you say,","Oh, you can get your realization,"]],[2338,["you are the truth, you are the Spirit,","they don’t want to listen to you."]],[2341,["They’re very funny people, you know.","They can’t believe it can be fine –"]],[2345,["why shouldn’t we have","confidence in ourselves?"]],[2348,["After all, are we going to seek it","again next year and next year?"]],[2351,["Why postpone it?","If it is so, why not have it?"]],[2359,["This is the first time the radio people","have allowed somebody to speak,"]],[2363,["while Sahaja Yoga has been","growing very slowly."]],[2366,["If the media help us, you see,","understanding how important it is and vital,"]],[2370,["that it should grow in these countries,","because in India it’s much easier,"]],[2375,["much easier, I mean thousands and thousands","it’s working out in the villages and all."]],[2378,["But here, you see,","media’s so important and so powerful."]],[2381,["Thank God we are not so developed,","so we don’t depend on media so much in India"]],[2385,["(laughs)"]],[2385,["and the newspaper people also understand","that truth has to be there,"]],[2391,["and they help us,","they have been very helpful in India,"]],[2394,["compared to here."]],[2396,["Here nobody wants to even publish","an article on Sahaja Yoga – nothing."]],[2400,["Can you imagine?","Nobody wants to do anything about it."]],[2411,["Question – Do all the Sahaja Yogis","use your photograph when they meditate?"]],[2426,["Yes, now, I don’t know who told you that."]],[2429,["I’d say it should not be told, because you see,","people get frightened with the idea"]],[2433,["that why use My photograph, you see","is the problem, it’s this way."]],[2436,["Now, see, the trouble is","My photograph has got vibrations."]],[2443,["Now, what to do?","The problem is like this."]],[2447,["It has tremendous vibrations, not only,","but it can cure people."]],[2451,["There was a boy in America","who was down with blood cancer,"]],[2458,["and the parents of the boy came to see me","in a very far-fetched village,"]],[2467,["and they wanted that","the boy should be cured."]],[2471,["So, I said, All right, give me","his photograph, I’ll work on it."]],[2475,["But in any case, I sent them,","asked them to telephone"]],[2481,["one of the Sahaja Yogis in New York.","She has only My photograph,"]],[2486,["and she used it and the boy is cured."]],[2488,["Now, supposing if it is so,","say it’s a penicillin injection,"]],[2491,["or you can call it something, you see,","a miracle drug, for example,"]],[2496,["say My photograph is,","then should we not use it?"]],[2499,["Now, supposing it is,","that’s what it is."]],[2503,["What can I do about it?"]],[2504,["I didn’t know the camera","would be so good, really, I didn’t know."]],[2508,["Camera is much more sensitive","than human beings are, I must tell you."]],[2513,["There are so many things","that camera has caught up,"]],[2516,["which human beings cannot catch."]],[2518,["Like, one day I was sitting in a village","giving lecture in a place"]],[2524,["where a realized soul had died –","a great realized soul."]],[2531,["And the camera caught – I mean I can feel it,","but you people do not see it with your eyes –"]],[2534,["a great flood of light","was falling on My head – a flood of light,"]],[2539,["and the camera caught it,","and six times it happened"]],[2541,["and the camera caught it six times,","and seventh time I just did like this"]],[2546,["and it stopped. Just there, in the camera."]],[2547,["I don’t know if they have","brought the photograph,"]],[2548,["but we have that photograph with us","and you can see for yourself, you see."]],[2551,["Camera is so sensitive","and so honest and so deep"]],[2559,["that the way things have been shown","by a camera."]],[2563,["The other day somebody took","photograph of My feet in India,"]],[2569,["with that instant camera,","and both My feet, you see,"]],[2577,["I was telling them that these two centers","are working very much,"]],[2580,["and they are on the Feet, you see,","and from My toe you could see"]],[2584,["a shaft of light coming out","from one of the toes and one of the fingers,"]],[2589,["which I had said these centers are catching.","So, camera caught it."]],[2592,["There must be something about me also,","isn’t it? Must be, of course."]],[2595,["It’s there, but is better to see","and I always tell Sahaja Yogis"]],[2599,["not to tell about the photograph,","just now to anyone,"]],[2602,["because if you tell them they get upset."]],[2604,["You see, they think Oh, God,","is She going to dominate me?"]],[2610,["(laughs, general laughter)"]],[2610,["You know, we are so frightened","of domination, isn’t it,"]],[2612,["because people have been very dominating."]],[2614,["But could be somebody loves you very much,","that even the photograph of hers"]],[2618,["can love you so much, isn’t it?","Could be."]],[2621,["Something we cannot think of –","someone who is just love."]],[2625,["And the photograph has that","love within itself."]],[2627,["You can use it as you like.","Then there should be no objection."]],[2637,["None of the people before me","were photographed."]],[2640,["Christ was never photographed,","Buddha was not photographed,"]],[2645,["even Mahommed was not photographed."]],[2647,["This is the first time you have developed","this wonderful thing called camera,"]],[2651,["and there’s my photograph.","What to do?"]],[2655,["In Hong Kong, the lady who was in charge –","I mean, Chinese have very wise people –"]],[2663,["and this lady, who was in charge","of that TV center,"]],[2670,["she felt the vibrations and all that,"]],[2672,["and she said Mother, why not we use You","on the TV?"]],[2674,["I said, Good idea,","and she put me there, on the TV"]],[2678,["for about three minutes, just standing,","and she said."]],[2679,["Just put your hands","towards the photograph and see,"]],[2682,["and so many got cool breeze","and they wrote to us saying that,"]],[2684,["We got cool breeze in our hands","from Mother."]],[2687,["And we have established a center","in Hong Kong, only by these things."]],[2693,["If your TV people ever allow Me to do that,","I could help, in a very great way, isn’t it?"]],[2700,["And would you not like to do it?"]],[2701,["I mean, supposing you were in My place,","it would have been better, I know,"]],[2704,["but you cannot be."]],[2707,["Anybody in My place can come and do it,","I’ll be very happy."]],[2711,["But that’s the trouble, you see,","Christ has to bear the Cross,"]],[2716,["He had to do it, nobody could do it."]],[2719,["We don’t mind Him doing that,","but why should we mind Him being the Christ?"]],[2726,["Somebody has to do it. Alright?"]],[2735,["And you will do it, too.","Even you can give realization to people."]],[2739,["You can give realization –","all of them can give realization,"]],[2741,["they can cure,","they are all experts sitting here,"]],[2744,["one better than the other."]],[2746,["When you talk to them, you’ll be amazed;","they’re all scholars!"]],[2748,["Somebody sitting next to you is quite good!"]],[2752,["(laughs)","Both the sides, I should say!"]],[2758,["It is rather difficult","to accept a photograph,"]],[2762,["because it is said that you should not","bow to any."]],[2765,["It was said because there were","no photographs before, nothing was there."]],[2770,["Photograph is such a truthful thing."]],[2773,["And you will see yourself, later on,","then you won’t give up, I know that,"]],[2777,["you’ll like it. Alright?"]],[2784,["Any other question?"]],[2797,["A photograph – we also have","symbolic value for photographs,"]],[2800,["say, for example,","we have the Queen’s photograph here."]],[2803,["We’ll not spit on her photograph, will we?","She’s not there."]],[2807,["Will you spit on her photograph,","any one of you?"]],[2809,["Will not, because after all that photo,","that thing represents something,"]],[2813,["is a symbol, isn’t it?"]],[2822,["It may not give vibrations","but definitely it is a symbol of something."]],[2829,["It is a coefficience of the whole thing","that works out this."]],[2836,["Even when I am talking to you,","you’ll be amazed,"]],[2840,["something is working out within yourself.","The sound also carries the vibrations."]],[2846,["You cannot see, but so many Sahaja Yogis","have seen the vibrations going into it."]],[2850,["You start seeing all these things."]],[2853,["So, you have to develop up to that point,","before that we don’t tell you anything"]],[2857,["about how to become collectively conscious","in a permanent way."]],[2864,["In the beginning we just say,","All right, you let us give you the light."]],[2868,["First you feel the light,","then you start seeing everything."]],[2877,["Nothing is compulsory in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2879,["but you yourselves start doing things","because you know it is so."]],[2888,["Should we have realization? All right."]],[2898,["Those who are new people","should come forward."]],[2901,["I would request – is better if all are","on the second (row),"]],[2906,["all those who are realized should get up","and these, if you look at these people,"]],[2910,["they look just like you, isn’t it?","But they are all realized souls."]],[2913,["They’re all realized souls, and experts.","This one is another expert."]],[2918,["He used to sell wine before."]],[2926,["(laughs, general laughter)","Yes, yes! It’s true, yes."]],[2928,["They are all around you,","in front of you, behind you."]],[2938,["Can you come forward, please?","Please. It’s better. Please,"]],[2944,["there are seats there. Here are some seats","if some people want to come down."]],[2959,["It’s better to be in the front seat,","because later on, you see,"]],[2963,["if there is a problem","with your Kundalini rising –"]],[2965,["why don’t you come here, my child?","Come along, you, both of you, come along."]],[2969,["If there’s any problem,","then the Sahaja Yogis can look after it;"]],[2972,["they can raise the Kundalini","with their own hands,"]],[2974,["because the power is flowing","from their hands, you see;"]],[2977,["so they can raise the Kundalini","and can give you realization,"]],[2981,["and then, once you have got realization,","you can give realizations to others."]],[2986,["Is as simple as that."]],[2987,["Today they are realized souls,","tomorrow you will be realized soul."]],[2991,["All of you have to become realized souls."]],[2993,["How many will become, God alone knows,","but there should be many, even in the West,"]],[2999,["where things are moving rather slowly","compared to India."]],[3003,["But it will, it will happen I’m sure."]],[3011,["Now, for getting realization,","it’s a very simple method."]],[3016,["Is that you have to expose yourself,","your fingers."]],[3019,["You see, these fingertips are the ends","of all the sympathetic nervous system,"]],[3025,["and these two hands","represent those seven centers,"]],[3031,["like one, two, three, four, five, six","and seven."]],[3036,["Seven centers,","as you see in the hands there;"]],[3038,["exactly like that.","You can even tally it later on, you can see."]],[3042,["For example, if you have a liver trouble","you can feel them on your fingers."]],[3046,["Everything you can feel on your fingertips,","they said On my fingertips,"]],[3050,["that’s how you become an expert."]],[3052,["English language has many","unconscious expressions,"]],[3055,["which has shown that,","how you become realized."]],[3060,["Now, so, what happens,","that you just have to close your eyes."]],[3064,["First of all, you must close your eyes,","because, when Kundalini rises"]],[3067,["and pierces through this center of Christ,","then there’s dilatation of the pupil,"]],[3072,["so we want your eyes to be closed","at that time so the Kundalini rises smoothly,"]],[3076,["and then She pierces out from here."]],[3079,["When She pierces out from here,","you can feel the cool breeze"]],[3083,["coming out of your head, you can feel it,","but you have to have little,"]],[3088,["melting of the sensitivity, you see."]],[3089,["Some people are not so sensitive","and they do not feel it."]],[3092,["Doesn’t matter. If you don’t feel it today,","you’ll feel it tomorrow."]],[3096,["But most of them feel it,","and these people, are the Sahaja Yogis,"]],[3100,["will look after you."]],[3100,["So, we have to be wise,","we have to be sensible about it,"]],[3105,["and it will work out."]],[3107,["It will work out with all of you,","it has to work out, you are seekers,"]],[3111,["this is your right to have it,","and you are having it because it is your right."]],[3114,["I am just here like –","I tell all these people that I am like a bank,"]],[3118,["which is cashing your checks."]],[3121,["You have done good work in your last lives,","and these lives, and you are not wrongdoers;"]],[3125,["you are good people."]],[3126,["You are seekers, and you are seekers of God,","of ancient times."]],[3130,["You’ve come here to take your realization;","you’d better get it."]],[3133,["It’s as simple as that.","My job is to give you realization."]],[3138,["I’m paid for it; you can think like that,","and that is what it is,"]],[3142,["and you have to have it."]],[3143,["There is no quarrel between you and Me.","If you don’t want to have it, it’s all right."]],[3148,["But it is with Me all the time, safe;","whenever you want, you can have it."]],[3152,["But better to have it as soon as possible."]],[3156,["Now, put your hands towards Me like this,","and just close your eyes."]],[3161,["Just close your eyes and you’ll be amazed","the difference it will create."]],[3179,["Just put both the hands towards Me.","I mean, it is a simple method."]],[3182,["Why you are putting it because","these centers must be exposed."]],[3186,["Is important. Very simple;","it is very simple method."]],[3192,["Please close your eyes.","Please close your eyes, just close your eyes."]],[3214,["Now, there are problems within ourselves.","They show up in our Kundalini rising."]],[3220,["Not to you, but to the people","who are sitting here who are realized souls,"]],[3224,["and when you are realized souls","you will also feel the same."]],[3228,["At this time the problem is on the heart,","there’s too much pressure on the heart."]],[3234,["I would request all of you not to open your eyes,","not to open your eyes,"]],[3237,["but put your right hand on your heart,","inside your coat, jackets;"]],[3242,["just on the heart,","especial on your heart,"]],[3245,["and in the heart resides the Spirit."]],[3248,["Just put your left hand,","and you can ask the question,"]],[3252,["a very fundamental question","within your heart,"]],[3255,["you can ask Me a question","within your heart,"]],[3257,["Mother, am I the Spirit?"]],[3259,["Just to ask that question,","because you are the Spirit;"]],[3262,["but just ask that question. Ask thrice."]],[3279,["Now, while talking to you about Sahaja Yoga","I might have said something that might&nbsp;&nbsp;"]],[3285,["have upset you,"]],[3286,["or you might be thinking that","I have done this wrong and that wrong,"]],[3290,["but forget the past."]],[3294,["In Sahaja Yoga there’s nothing like sin","when you come for your realization;"]],[3297,["it’s all washed off,","so don’t worry about that,"]],[3300,["and don’t feel guilty."]],[3301,["If you feel guilty,","of course there’s a problem,"]],[3304,["but you just say, within yourself,","in your heart, that Mother, I am not guilty."]],[3308,["You are not guilty at all anymore now."]],[3314,["Anything you have done, anything that you","think is very wrong, forget it for the time being."]],[3321,["Just forget it, and say, thrice,","Mother, I am not guilty."]],[3337,["Now the third thing you have to ask","is to say,"]],[3340,["Mother, am I my own master,","am I my own guru?"]],[3348,["Also, ask this question three times."]],[3371,["Please put both the feet on the ground,","in a straight way,"]],[3374,["you see the Mother Earth helps us by that."]],[3386,["Now, you may ask a question again, saying,","Mother, am I the part and parcel of the whole?"]],[3414,["Please don’t feel guilty,","please don’t feel guilty,"]],[3417,["please don’t feel guilty."]],[3423,["It’s a fashion, I tell you, feeling guilty;","is a competition, who feels more guilty."]],[3432,["People like to have some sort of","Greek tragedies artificially built"]],[3438,["around their lives."]],[3442,["(chuckles)"]],[3486,["Please ask the question","Am I the part and parcel of the whole?"]],[3490,["Just ask the question, please,","because collectivity comes to people"]],[3495,["who are large-hearted, who are big-hearted,","big people, who are not small."]],[3585,["Now, please put both the hands towards Me.","Both the hands,"]],[3589,["and just say Mother, I have forgiven","all the people."]],[3596,["I’ve forgiven everyone."]],[3599,["Please put both the hands towards Me,","and just forgive everyone,"]],[3603,["forgive everyone."]],[3605,["Say I have forgiven everyone, Mother,","I have forgiven everyone."]],[3608,["Forgive!"]],[3622,["Now, you have to say this because","I cannot go against your freedom,"]],[3628,["you are free to choose,","so you have to say"]],[3632,["Mother, may I have my realization?"]],[3635,["Will You please give me realization?","because I cannot force it upon you,"]],[3640,["you have to ask for it. It’s your freedom.","Just ask for it."]]]);
